  "title": "Central Australia is ours",
  "briefing": "Meridian Combine holds Central Australia through its signal tower. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 16 enemy agents and 6 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Central Australia Blackout: Meridian Combine runs Central Australia from its signal tower, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Central Australia wakes up with the signal tower in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Central Australia before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
